{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"fcaa20905e646fef52638ee11406d121669ccd5d9c1cdf8154b5f6c31cc2988f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2452},"chapter":{"number":32,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["認罪與蒙赦"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["大衛的訓誨詩。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"得赦免其過、遮蓋其罪的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這人是有福的！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡心裏沒有詭詐、耶和華不算為有罪的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這人是有福的！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"我閉口不認罪的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因終日唉哼而骨頭枯乾。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"黑夜白日，你的手在我身上沉重；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的精液耗盡，如同夏天的乾旱。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"我向你陳明我的罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不隱瞞我的惡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我說：我要向耶和華承認我的過犯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你就赦免我的罪惡。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"為此，凡虔誠人都當趁你可尋找的時候禱告你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大水泛溢的時候，必不能到他那裏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是我藏身之處；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必保佑我脫離苦難，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以得救的樂歌四面環繞我。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"我要教導你，指示你當行的路；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要定睛在你身上勸戒你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不可像那無知的騾馬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必用嚼環轡頭勒住牠；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不然，就不能馴服。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"惡人必多受苦楚；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惟獨倚靠耶和華的必有慈愛四面環繞他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們義人應當靠耶和華歡喜快樂；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們心裏正直的人都當歡呼。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/32.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/33.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/31.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}